[Cheats/Enable Debug Menu At Boot Game Mode Select The first line controls the game mode type. Press Left, Right to change the game mode number. Press X to enter the selected game mode.Level Select The second line controls the level you will enter.Plane SelectThe third line controls the selected plane BGM Test Press L1, R1 to change the BGM number. Press Square to play BGM.Sound Test Press L2, R2 to change the SFX number. Press Circle to play SFX]
